{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>AI演講教練是一款專注提升口語表達能力的應用程式，適合學生、求職者、上班族及內容創作者。無論是想減少口頭禪、改善發音與語速，還是為演講或面試做準備，這款工具都能透過每日練習、情境訓練與即時回饋，幫助你建立更自信、更有條理的說話習慣。現在它正推出終生版內購限時免費活動，讓你無需付費就能獲得完整功能。</p>\n\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>AI演講教練：清晰流利表達 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-55-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-56-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-57-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-58-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-59-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-60-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AI演講教練：清晰流利表達</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-07T09:40:02.045220+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}